SmartPass - Sprint 1 Progress
This sprint focused on building the authentication and role personalization foundation.

 - Authentication & Security: Implemented email/password registration, secure login/logout, forgot password recovery, and persistent login via Firebase Auth.

 - Role-Based Access Control (RBAC): Integrated Firestore to detect user roles (Student vs. Invigilator) and route them securely.

 - Custom Dashboards: Built distinct UI interfaces for Students (Exam Slips & Break History) and Invigilators (Active out quotas, timers, and check-in actions).

 - User Profiles: Enabled users to view their personal data fetched directly from the database.

